10点钟方向\n          </strong>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;min-height: 1em;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 1px;text-align: center;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<strong>\n<br/>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7TibbwMPk7ov37j6W0JL3ibEnvxsElsYWckZa08D5tNBniaicdZ5tHOIOqHwzzfbKwjrict37nxckIcicAw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;min-height: 1em;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 1px;text-align: center;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7TibbwMPk7ov37j6W0JL3ibEnMlpGZJvRI613fAn30sWlUibIia8v8icYrib5iaRTY3vDVZIXKvOIOImhCJg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          我们带了 (现场出品以及整袋售卖）\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            埃塞 CoE #1 （非竞标批次）\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            埃塞 Ana Sora 厌氧日晒\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            肯尼亚 Thageini  超级日晒\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            哥斯达黎加 CoE #21 Don Jose Gesha 日晒\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            洪都拉斯 Los Pinos Gesha 日晒\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            危地马拉 CoE #9 La Hermosa Gesha 日晒\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            危地马拉 La Reforma Gesha 水洗\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            巴拿马 Hartmann Gesha 水洗\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            巴布亚新几内亚 Baroida 厌氧日晒\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            巴布亚新几内亚 Baroida 蜜处理\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            巴布亚新几内亚 Kobuta 水洗\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            中国云南保山佐园超级日晒\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            中国云南普文蔓飞龙超级日晒 N2 / N3\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            中国云南普洱澜沧宏丰超级日晒\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          意式：\n         </span>\n</p>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            PNG All-in (Baroida Natural 25% + Baroida Washed 15% + Baroida Honey 15% + Kobuta Washed 15% + Boka Washed 15% + Morita Washed 15%) - 又是一款概念拼配，我都没喝过，来一起咯～\n           </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            Olive （Baroida Washed 50% + Worka Washed 10% + Worka Natural 10% + Canet Raisin Honey 30%）浅焙，这个就不说啥了\n           </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            Lucky Draw (Baoshan Washed 60% + Lamari Washed 20% + Baoshan SDN 20%) 深焙，奶咖超级好喝，现场俺们隔壁DECADE小哥哥就用它来做好多好多美丽上头的特饮哦～\n            <br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          还有很多好看好喝的挂耳包\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          欢迎来现场蹭吃蹭喝，哈哈哈哈哈\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          嗷嗷，对了，11.2下午2:30 还有俺一个分享活动，主题是“一起品尝特殊处理风味”\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7TibbwMPk7ov37j6W0JL3ibEnyib9htrrib1sl0mcpaSjSUFEXzwYPs0uZicpgiaXmfhIXTm9YIfKYNic9uA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7TibbwMPk7ov37j6W0JL3ibEnyQib5bEQKm4MgNGblfM2xbX6MAbBvnoTxRjEjB9vfb8uOP0jLic1GfBw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          我估摸着前面艺术生肯定要拖堂，我这边准备了12只豆子，杯测形式串着聊一下，时间好紧张呀～\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          更多关于活动的内容，请查阅还有生活官方发布\n         </span>\n<a data-linktype=\"2\" href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU3MzY0MzA3MQ==&amp;mid=2247496585&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=62d89f868f1166f6c11e13381ad15338&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\" tab=\"outerlink\" target=\"_blank\" textvalue=\"链接👉链接\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           链接👉链接\n          </span>\n</a>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          需要门票的可后台留言哈\n         </span>\n</section>\n</div>",
